ndwidth\uff09 \u2014 SONiC \u306e QoS \u30b9\u30b1\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0\uff08SP/WRR/DWRR\uff09\u3068\u30b7\u30a7\u30fc\u30d4\u30f3\u30b0\uff08min/max \u5e2f\u57df\uff09\u3092 SCHEDULER\u30fbQUEUE \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3067\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3059\u308b\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/sonic-qos-scheduler-and-shaping.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T19:46:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:46:32+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-concepts/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-concepts/", "title": "Error Handling Framework \u6982\u5ff5\uff08ERROR_DB / SWSS_RC / \u5831\u544a\u306e\u307f\u306e\u8cac\u52d9\uff09", "content_html": "Error Handling Framework HLD \u306e\u6982\u5ff5\u6574\u7406\u3002SAI \u5931\u6557\u3092 fatal \u6271\u3044\u305b\u305a ERROR_DB \u7d4c\u7531\u3067 app \u306b\u4f1d\u642c\u3059\u308b\u8a2d\u8a08\u601d\u60f3\u3001framework \u81ea\u4f53\u306f report \u306e\u307f\u3067 retry/rollback \u3092\u62c5\u308f\u306a\u3044\u8cac\u52d9\u5206\u62c5\u3001\u5bfe\u8c61 table \u3068 SWSS error code \u4f53\u7cfb\u3092\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-concepts.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T19:46:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T20:56:08+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-operations/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-operations/", "title": "SmartSwitch HA HAMgrD CONFIG/APP/STATE_DB \u30b9\u30ad\u30fc\u30de\uff08\u8a2d\u5b9a\u7d4c\u8def\uff09", "content_html": "HAMgrD \u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u7d4c\u8def\u3002DASH_HA_GLOBAL_CONFIG / DASH_HA_SET_CONFIG / DASH_HA_SCOPE_CONFIG \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3001\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3059\u308b STATE \u7cfb\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3001\u73fe\u72b6\u5b9f\u88c5\u3067\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f\u53ef\u80fd\u306a\u90e8\u5206\u306e\u904b\u7528\u691c\u8a3c\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9\u4f8b\u3092\u6271\u3046\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-operations.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T19:46:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T20:40:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/hld-ldap/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/hld-ldap/", "title": "LDAP \u8a8d\u8a3c\uff08hostcfgd / nslcd / NSS / PAM \u9023\u643a\uff09", "content_html": "LDAP \u8a8d\u8a3c\uff08hostcfgd / nslcd / NSS / PAM \u9023\u643a\uff09 \u2014 SONiC \u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u306e SSH / \u30b7\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\u30ed\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\u3092 \u5916\u90e8 LDAP \u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u3067\u8a8d\u8a3c \u3067\u304d\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3059\u308b Phase 1 \u8a2d\u8a08\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/hld-ldap.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T19:46:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:18:31+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/liquid-cooling-leakage-detection-in-sonic/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/liquid-cooling-leakage-detection-in-sonic/", "title": "\u6db2\u51b7\u6f0f\u6d29\u691c\u51fa\uff08LiquidCoolingBase + thermalctld + system-health gNMI \u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8\uff09", "content_html": "\u6db2\u51b7\u6f0f\u6d29\u691c\u51fa\uff08LiquidCoolingBase + thermalctld + system-health gNMI \u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8\uff09 \u2014 \u9ad8\u5bc6\u5ea6\u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u3067\u306f\u7a7a\u51b7\u3067\u306f\u71b1\u3092\u634c\u304d\u304d\u308c\u305a\u6db2\u51b7\uff08Liquid Cooling\uff09\u304c\u5fc5\u9808\u3068\u306a\u308b\u304c\u3001\u6db2\u6f0f\u308c\u306f\u5373\u5ea7\u306b\u81f4\u547d\u7684\u6545\u969c\u306b\u3064\u306a\u304c\u308b\u305f\u3081\u3001\u5c02\u7528 polling \u3068 gNMI \u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8\u3067\u5373\u6642\u901a\u77e5\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/platform/liquid-cooling-leakage-detection-in-sonic.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T19:46:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T17:43:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "title": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary)", "content_html": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary) \u2014 SONiC NOS \u3067\u983b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u56fa\u6709\u7528\u8a9e\u30fb\u7565\u8a9e\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u540d\u3092\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30d9\u30c3\u30c8\u9806\u306b\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306f\u300c\u7528\u8a9e / \u7565\u79f0 / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a33 / \u7c21\u6f54\u306a\u8aac\u660e / \u95a2\u9023\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u300d\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u8a18\u8f09\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T19:46:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-system-health/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-system-health/", "title": "show system-health \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9", "content_html": "show system-health \u306f system-health \u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3 (HealthCheckerManager) \u304c\u4fdd\u6301\u3059\u308b\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u72b6\u614b (\u30b5\u30fc\u30d3\u30b9\u30fb\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u30fb\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u306a\u3069) \u3068\u3001SmartSwitch \u69cb\u6210\u3067\u306e DPU \u72b6\u614b\u3001\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u304c boot \u5b8c\u4e86\u3057\u305f\u304b\u306e sysready \u72b6\u614b\u3092\u8868\u793a\u3059\u308b CLI \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9\u7fa4\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/show-system-health.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T19:46:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:03:57+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-nvgre-tunnel/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-nvgre-tunnel/", "title": "sonic-nvgre-tunnel YANG", "content_html": "sonic-nvgre-tunnel YANG \u2014 NVGRE \u30c8\u30f3\u30cd\u30eb\u3068\u305d\u308c\u306b\u7d10\u4ed8\u304f VLAN-VSID \u30de\u30c3\u30d4\u30f3\u30b0\u3092\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3059\u308b YANG \u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-nvgre-tunnel.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T19:46:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T08:00:41+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/segment-routing-over-ipv6-srv6-hld/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/segment-routing-over-ipv6-srv6-hld/", "title": "SRv6\uff08Segment Routing over IPv6 / END.DT46 / H.Encaps.Red\uff09", "content_html": "SRv6\uff08Segment Routing over IPv6 / END.DT46 / H.Encaps.Red\uff09 